      "writtenOn": "2025-10-15T14:54:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure why this is here? Seems an adapter like this should go into a `SkXPSPngHelpers.h` something like the existing `SkPDFJpegHelpers.h`. This would also smooth over some issues later if we needed to actually pass some options along since that implementation could be changed instead of arbitrarily mucking with this one.\n\nLogically, the issue with that this isn\u0027t really \"default options\" but \"xps options\" which currently happens to be empty (and doesn\u0027t have to be, it should probably be taking a compression level, etc).",
