      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sure, it would make sense to have both `include/docs/SkXPSPngRustHelpers.h` and `include/docs/SkXPSPngLibpngHelpers.h`. These would need to be handled like `include/docs/SkPDFJpegHelpers.h`, in the Bazel build specified in `include/docs/BUILD.bazel` and then generated into the gn build at `gn/xps.gni` via `bazel/exporter_tool/main.go` the same way the `pdf_jpeg_hdrs` Bazel target is.",
      "parentUuid": "a1eb86e6_060ac3a5",
