      "message": "Done.\n\nPS. Just a heads-up I guess / for now this is not a problem (because there is no Bazel coverage for these files).  Eventually Bazel will require declaring whether the library with `SkXPSDocument.cpp` depends on `SkXPSPngRustHelpers.h` VS on `SkXPSPngLibPngHelpers.h`.  (I guess the same problem would happen if those headers were part of `include/encode/BUILD.bazel`.)",
