      "writtenOn": "2025-10-15T17:04:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Eventually (very soon) all the users will need to be updated and `SkXPSDocument.cpp` will not depend on either. Even as things are the Bazel build could work by just always setting `SK_DISABLE_LEGACY_XPS_FACTORIES`.\n\nAlso, need to add these (in their own targets) in `include/docs/BUILD.bazel` and `bazel/exporter_tool/main.go` updated to export them into `gn/xps.gni` (run `make -C bazel generate_gni` or equivalent as described in `bazel/exporter_tool/README.md`.\n\nShould also update `XPSSink::draw` in `DMSrcSkink.cpp` to call the new `SkXPS::MakeDocument`. See `PDFSink::draw` for the equivalent there. May need to update the build of the `skia` target in `BUILD.gn` to depend on one of the new `xps_libpng_helpers` or `xps_rustpng_helpers` like the existing dependency on `pdf_jpeg_helpers`.",
